{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "4d7cc98f-c5b4-8bb5-a832-9bd915c9c83d",
  "created_at": "2026-01-06T10:10:27-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Canvassing",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Barbara N. Wilcox",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Walter Tavares",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:08:00-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning, City of Newport Canvassing, this is Walter. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:08:06-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, good morning. Um, I'm calling because I need to figure out where I vote. I moved over the summer, well, not far, but it's a different side of town than where I was, and I got some mail a while back that I think was about it, but I couldn't tell you where it went. It's probably under the stack by the toaster."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:08:28-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem at all. I can look that up for you. Can I have your full name and date of birth?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:08:36-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Barbara N. Wilcox. Born March ninth, nineteen seventy-one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:08:40-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Ms. Wilcox. One moment while I pull that up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:08:45-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Oh, hang on. Somebody just rang my doorbell. It's a delivery driver, I can see the truck. I'm just going to ignore it, I'm on the phone. They can leave it on the step."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:08:58-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, take your time. Okay, I have you here. Your polling place is the Pell Elementary School gymnasium. The entrance is on the side, and there will be signs on voting days."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:09:10-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Pell Elementary, gym, side entrance. Okay. I thought it was the church hall, that's where I used to go. Which is a whole thing, because the parking there was awful, and my sister always said..."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:09:23-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, the old precinct was different. Is there anything else I can look up for you today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:09:30-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, yes. Sorry. What ID do I need to bring? Do I need a driver's license, or is something else okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:09:38-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Rhode Island asks for a photo ID at the polls. A driver's license works, as does a passport or a student ID. A few other kinds are accepted too. If you don't have one with you, you can still vote by provisional ballot, but you'd need to follow up afterward."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:09:56-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so license, and I have one. Good. Is the address on it a problem? It still has my old address."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:10:04-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The address doesn't need to match. The photo and name are what matter. But you might want to update your registration if you haven't, and I see you already have, so you're set."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:10:16-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. That's all I needed. Gym at Pell, bring the license. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:10:21-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Ms. Wilcox. Have a good day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:10:25-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye."
    }
  ],
